---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Marine & Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory" description="Welder qualification, WPS and PQR with approvals from DNV, ABS, LR and BV." nav="services" page="service-welding" mainClass="svc-detail">

  <section class="hero page ph-service sd-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap sd-grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag">Service 07 of 8</span>
        <h1>Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory</h1>
        <p class="sub">Welder qualification, WPS and PQR with approvals from DNV, ABS, LR and BV.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="wrap sd-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/services/">← All services</a><span>/</span><b>Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory</b></nav>
      
      <div class="sd-top reveal">
        <figure class="sd-pic plate">
          <img src="/images/svc-welding.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 50%" alt="Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory">
          
        </figure>
        <section class="sd-block first">
          <h4><span>01</span>What we do</h4>
          <p>We provide comprehensive Welder Qualification, Welding Procedure Specification (WPS), PQR and class liaison services for shipyards, afloat ship repair contractors, marine fabricators and industrial fabricators. We manage the entire technical and bureaucratic lifecycle required to secure official workshop and personnel approvals from leading international Classification Societies (e.g. DNV, ABS, LR, BV).</p><p>By pairing practical metallurgical engineering with rigorous regulatory liaison, we eliminate failed laboratory tests, prevent project delays and ensure your facility maintains full, audit-ready commercial compliance.</p>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
      <section class="sd-block reveal">
        <h4><span>02</span>Why partner with us</h4>
        
        
        <p>We deliver specialized advisory services to qualify welders and certify welding procedures (WPS/WPQR) across the marine, offshore energy and heavy industrial sectors. We bridge the gap between technical execution and strict international standards, ensuring your fabrication workflows meet all major Classification Society and international code mandates.</p>
      </section>
      
      <div class="sd-talk plate reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Talk to our team</span>
        <h3>Interested in Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory?</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your vessel or project and we'll come back with a clear plan.</p>
        <a class="btn plate" href="/contact/">Enquire now <span class="ar">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <nav class="sd-pn">
        <a href="/services/chartering/"><span class="k">← Previous</span><span class="t">Ship Chartering Support</span></a>
        <a class="sd-all btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services</a>
        <a class="r" href="/services/inspection/"><span class="k">Next →</span><span class="t">Fabrication Inspection Services (QA/QC)</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
